<title>USA: Toyota April US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota April US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Apr 1-30, 1997     Apr 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    51,381	    44,364	    +15.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   9,992	    10,075	     -0.8</p>
<p> Import Car		17,009	    16,546	     +2.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    19,689	    18,412	     +6.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Apr 30, 1997 Jan 1-Apr 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   213,642	   168,856	    +27.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  44,434	    43,227	     +3.8</p>
<p> Import Car		74,217	    73,578	     +1.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	    80,184	    64,768	    +25.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 102 for year to date vs 103 in year ago.</p>
</text>
